    "merseytram": {
      "name": "Merseytram",
      "status": "abandoned",
      "description": "Merseytravel's three-line tram network: Line 1 from the waterfront and city centre to Kirkby, a City Centre Loop by the Pier Head, and Line 2 to Prescot and Whiston Hospital (Line 3 to the airport was never detailed). Line 1 won its Transport and Works Act order in December 2004, but the government withdrew funding in November 2005 and the powers lapsed in 2013; Line 2 got no further than public consultation in 2004.",
